{"id":"3b975446-304a-4785-b080-7464f3d23490","meta":{"description":"Watch your sitemap daily, deduplicate submitted URLs with a Data Table, and push fresh pages to Google Search Console, Bing Webmaster and IndexNow. A deterministic priority classifier sends cornerstone pages to all three engines in parallel and content pages to two. One Telegram digest closes the run.","templateName":"Keep new pages indexed on Google, Bing and IndexNow","templateDescription":"Watch your sitemap daily, deduplicate submitted URLs with a Data Table, and push fresh pages to Google Search Console, Bing Webmaster and IndexNow. A deterministic priority classifier sends cornerstone pages to all three engines in parallel and content pages to two. One Telegram digest closes the run."},"name":"Keep new pages indexed on Google, Bing and IndexNow","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"0f1ad558-ca0f-47d9-a493-01fc9ca88f3c","name":"Sticky Note","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-1824,-416],"parameters":{"width":480,"height":896,"content":"## Keep new pages indexed on Google, Bing and IndexNow\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow runs daily, fetches the site sitemap, parses it into individual URLs, and checks which URLs have not already been submitted. It classifies each new URL by priority, skips low-priority pages, and sends higher-priority URLs to Bing, IndexNow, and for cornerstone pages also resubmits the sitemap to Google Search Console. It then builds and sends a Telegram digest summarizing the run and indexing submissions.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Set the schedule trigger time and update the sitemap URL in the Fetch Sitemap node to your domain’s sitemap or sitemap index.\n- Configure the Data Table nodes used to track submitted URLs so the workflow can avoid duplicate submissions.\n- Add credentials or API keys for Bing Webmaster URL submission, IndexNow, and Google Search Console sitemap submission.\n- Configure the IndexNow key and make sure the key file is hosted and accessible on the target domain if required.\n- Connect the Telegram bot credentials and set the target chat ID for the digest message.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the URL priority rules in the Classify URL Priority code node, change which branches submit to Google/Bing/IndexNow, or tune the daily schedule and Telegram digest format."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"5bab0429-f426-4df3-89ac-b55d21d09ec0","name":"Sticky Note1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-1264,96],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":432,"height":320,"content":"## Schedule and fetch sitemap\n\nStarts the workflow once per day and downloads the configured sitemap that will be inspected for new URLs."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"91dc56ac-a391-4e52-a95d-86932520dc59","name":"Sticky Note2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-768,96],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":448,"height":320,"content":"## Parse and deduplicate URLs\n\nConverts the sitemap XML into individual URL items and checks the tracking table so previously submitted URLs are not processed again."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"f025db0d-b769-4f60-83cf-729788e9f27f","name":"Sticky Note3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-240,96],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":448,"height":352,"content":"## Classify and route URLs\n\nAssigns each new URL a deterministic priority and branches the workflow into cornerstone, normal content, or low-priority handling paths."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"2f88e49a-fbe9-458a-b221-8ecbe7117a37","name":"Sticky Note4","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[256,-240],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":464,"content":"## Prepare cornerstone URLs\n\nMarks cornerstone URLs as submitted in the tracking table and aggregates them into a batch for indexing API calls."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"9f9be0ce-4424-4430-893c-f90308ea4da0","name":"Sticky Note5","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[720,-416],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":448,"height":672,"content":"## Submit cornerstone indexing\n\nSubmits cornerstone URL batches to Bing and IndexNow, resubmits the sitemap to Google Search Console, and merges the resulting API responses."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"0cc562d7-aeca-4aca-96d9-7e0847a46b98","name":"Sticky Note6","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[256,256],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":416,"height":480,"content":"## Prepare content URLs\n\nMarks standard content URLs as submitted and aggregates them into a batch for the normal content indexing path."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"627b3c90-2019-4745-b63b-60563956d717","name":"Sticky Note7","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[720,304],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":448,"height":496,"content":"## Submit content indexing\n\nSends standard content URL batches to Bing and IndexNow, then merges the returned submission results."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"1d6e3087-6d40-4a26-abb9-53b212deccd0","name":"Sticky Note8","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-16,480],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":240,"height":336,"content":"## Skip low priority URLs\n\nTerminates the low-priority branch without submitting those URLs to any indexing service."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"97030e63-9b1e-44ea-ae01-f5bbd0435d91","name":"Sticky Note9","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1232,96],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":432,"height":320,"content":"## Send Telegram report\n\nBuilds a single digest for the run using sitemap and submission counts, then sends the report to Telegram."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"a1e2b3c4-001-4000-8000-0000000000001","name":"When Daily at 9am","type":"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger","position":[-1220,260],"parameters":{"rule":{"interval":[{"field":"days","daysInterval":1,"triggerAtHour":9,"triggerAtMinute":0}]}},"typeVersion":1.3},{"id":"a1e2b3c4-002-4000-8000-0000000000002","name":"Fetch Sitemap XML","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","position":[-980,260],"parameters":{"url":"=https://YOUR_DOMAIN_ROOT/sitemap_index.xml","options":{"response":{"response":{"responseFormat":"text"}}}},"typeVersion":4.4},{"id":"a1e2b3c4-003-4000-8000-0000000000003","name":"Parse Sitemap URLs","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[-720,260],"parameters":{"mode":"runOnceForAllItems","jsCode":"// Parse sitemap XML into one item per URL. Handles plain <urlset> sitemaps\n// AND <sitemapindex> files (child fetches bounded to 20, failures skipped).\nconst raw = $input.first().json.data || $input.first().json.body || '';\nif (!raw) { return []; }\nconst urls = [];\nconst seen = new Set();\nconst add = (u) => { if (u && !seen.has(u)) { seen.add(u); urls.push(u); } };\nconst locs = String(raw).match(/<loc>([^<]+)<\\/loc>/g) || [];\nfor (const l of locs) add(l.replace(/<\\/?loc>/g, '').trim());\nif (/<sitemapindex/i.test(raw)) {\n  const kids = [...urls].slice(0, 20);\n  urls.length = 0; seen.clear();\n  for (const k of kids) {\n    try {\n      const res = await this.helpers.httpRequest({\n        method: 'GET', url: k,\n        headers: { 'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (compatible; n8n-seo-indexer/1.0)' },\n      });\n      const inner = String(res).match(/<loc>([^<]+)<\\/loc>/g) || [];\n      for (const l of inner) add(l.replace(/<\\/?loc>/g, '').trim());\n    } catch (err) { /* child unreachable: skip */ }\n  }\n}\nreturn urls.map(u => ({ json: { url: u } }));","language":"javaScript"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"a1e2b3c4-004-4000-8000-0000000000004","name":"Verify URL Submission","type":"n8n-nodes-base.dataTable","position":[-460,260],"parameters":{"filters":{"conditions":[{"keyName":"url","keyValue":"={{ $json.url }}","condition":"eq"}]},"resource":"row","matchType":"anyCondition","operation":"rowNotExists","dataTableId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"YOUR_DATA_TABLE_ID","cachedResultName":"SEO Indexer - Submitted URLs"}},"typeVersion":1.1},{"id":"a1e2b3c4-005-4000-8000-0000000000005","name":"Determine URL Priority","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[-200,260],"parameters":{"mode":"runOnceForAllItems","jsCode":"// Deterministic URL priority (no LLM, zero cost, explainable):\n//   2 = homepage / cornerstone pages -> all three engines\n//   1 = normal content pages        -> Bing + IndexNow\n//   0 = archives, feeds, utility   -> skipped by the Switch (crawl-budget hygiene)\nconst items = $input.all();\nconst out = [];\nfor (const it of items) {\n  const url = it.json.url || '';\n  const path = url.split('?')[0].replace(/\\/+$/, '');\n  const seg = path.replace(/^https?:\\/\\//, '').split('/').filter(Boolean);\n  const last = seg[seg.length - 1] || '';\n  let kind = 'content', priority = 1;\n  const isHome = seg.length === 1 || (seg.length === 2 && /^index\\.html?$/i.test(last));\n  if (isHome) { kind = 'homepage'; priority = 2; }\n  else if (/(^|\\/)(page\\/?\\d*|feed|amp|wp-json|wp-content|wp-admin|thank|cart|checkout|login)(\\/|$)/i.test(path)\n        || /\\/(category|tag|author|archive)\\//i.test(path)) { kind = 'utility'; priority = 0; }\n  else if (seg.length === 2 || /\\/(about|pricing|services|features|docs|start|guide)s?\\/?$/i.test(path)) { kind = 'cornerstone'; priority = 2; }\n  out.push({ json: { url: url, kind: kind, priority: priority } });\n}\nreturn out.length ? out : [];","language":"javaScript"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"a1e2b3c4-006-4000-8000-0000000000006","name":"Route by Priority Level","type":"n8n-nodes-base.switch","position":[60,260],"parameters":{"rules":{"values":[{"conditions":{"options":{"version":3,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"a1e2b3c4-801-4+1234567890","operator":{"type":"number","operation":"gte"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.priority }}","rightValue":2}]}},{"conditions":{"options":{"version":3,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"a1e2b3c4-802-4+1234567890","operator":{"type":"number","operation":"gte"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.priority }}","rightValue":1}]}}]},"options":{}},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"a1e2b3c4-007-4000-8000-0000000000007","name":"Bypass Low Priority URLs","type":"n8n-nodes-base.noOp","position":[32,672],"parameters":{},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"a1e2b3c4-010-4000-8000-0000000000010","name":"Note Cornerstone Submission","type":"n8n-nodes-base.dataTable","position":[300,60],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{"url":"={{ $json.url }}","kind":"={{ $json.kind }}","priority":"={{ $json.priority }}","first_seen":"={{ $now.toISO() }}"},"mappingMode":"manual"},"filters":{"conditions":[{"key_id":"YOUR_URL_COLUMN_ID","keyName":"url","keyValue":"={{ $json.url }}","condition":"eq"}]},"resource":"row","matchType":"anyCondition","operation":"upsert","dataTableId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"YOUR_DATA_TABLE_ID","cachedResultName":"SEO Indexer - Submitted URLs"}},"typeVersion":1.1},{"id":"a1e2b3c4-011-4000-8000-0000000000011","name":"Gather Cornerstone URLs","type":"n8n-nodes-base.aggregate","position":[520,-80],"parameters":{"options":{},"aggregate":"aggregateAllItemData","destinationFieldName":"url_list"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"a1e2b3c4-012-4000-8000-0000000000012","name":"Post Cornerstones to Bing","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"continueErrorOutput","position":[760,-260],"parameters":{"url":"=https://ssl.bing.com/webmaster/api.svc/json/SubmitUrlBatch?apikey=YOUR_BING_API_KEY","method":"POST","options":{"response":{"response":{"fullResponse":true}}},"jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify( { siteUrl: 'https://' + $json.url_list[0].url.split('/')[2], urlList: $json.url_list.map(i => i.url).slice(0, 40) } ) }}","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json"},"typeVersion":4.4},{"id":"a1e2b3c4-013-4000-8000-0000000000013","name":"Post Cornerstones to IndexNow","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"continueErrorOutput","position":[760,-80],"parameters":{"url":"=https://api.indexnow.org/indexnow","method":"POST","options":{"response":{"response":{"fullResponse":true}}},"jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify( { host: $json.url_list[0].url.split('/')[2], key: 'YOUR_INDEXNOW_KEY', keyLocation: 'https://YOUR_DOMAIN_ROOT/YOUR_INDEXNOW_KEY.txt', urlList: $json.url_list.map(i => i.url).slice(0, 10000) } ) }}","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json"},"typeVersion":4.4},{"id":"a1e2b3c4-014-4000-8000-0000000000014","name":"Resubmit Sitemap to Google API","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"continueErrorOutput","position":[760,100],"parameters":{"url":"=https://www.googleapis.com/webmasters/v3/sites/{{ encodeURIComponent('YOUR_SEARCH_CONSOLE_SITE') }}/sitemaps/{{ encodeURIComponent('https://YOUR_DOMAIN_ROOT/sitemap_index.xml') }}","method":"PUT","options":{"response":{"response":{"fullResponse":true}}},"authentication":"predefinedCredentialType","nodeCredentialType":"googleApi"},"typeVersion":4.4},{"id":"a1e2b3c4-015-4000-8000-0000000000015","name":"Combine Cornerstone Submissions","type":"n8n-nodes-base.merge","position":[1020,-80],"parameters":{"mode":"append","numberInputs":3},"typeVersion":3.2},{"id":"a1e2b3c4-020-4000-8000-0000000000020","name":"Record Content Submission","type":"n8n-nodes-base.dataTable","position":[304,416],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{"url":"={{ $json.url }}","kind":"={{ $json.kind }}","priority":"={{ $json.priority }}","first_seen":"={{ $now.toISO() }}"},"mappingMode":"manual"},"filters":{"conditions":[{"key_id":"YOUR_URL_COLUMN_ID","keyName":"url","keyValue":"={{ $json.url }}","condition":"eq"}]},"resource":"row","matchType":"anyCondition","operation":"upsert","dataTableId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"YOUR_DATA_TABLE_ID","cachedResultName":"SEO Indexer - Submitted URLs"}},"typeVersion":1.1},{"id":"a1e2b3c4-021-4000-8000-0000000000021","name":"Gather Content URLs","type":"n8n-nodes-base.aggregate","position":[528,576],"parameters":{"options":{},"aggregate":"aggregateAllItemData","destinationFieldName":"url_list"},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"a1e2b3c4-022-4000-8000-0000000000022","name":"Post Content to Bing","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"continueErrorOutput","position":[760,460],"parameters":{"url":"=https://ssl.bing.com/webmaster/api.svc/json/SubmitUrlBatch?apikey=YOUR_BING_API_KEY","method":"POST","options":{"response":{"response":{"fullResponse":true}}},"jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify( { siteUrl: 'https://' + $json.url_list[0].url.split('/')[2], urlList: $json.url_list.map(i => i.url).slice(0, 40) } ) }}","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json"},"typeVersion":4.4},{"id":"a1e2b3c4-023-4000-8000-0000000000023","name":"Post Content to IndexNow","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","onError":"continueErrorOutput","position":[760,640],"parameters":{"url":"=https://api.indexnow.org/indexnow","method":"POST","options":{"response":{"response":{"fullResponse":true}}},"jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify( { host: $json.url_list[0].url.split('/')[2], key: 'YOUR_INDEXNOW_KEY', keyLocation: 'https://YOUR_DOMAIN_ROOT/YOUR_INDEXNOW_KEY.txt', urlList: $json.url_list.map(i => i.url).slice(0, 10000) } ) }}","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json"},"typeVersion":4.4},{"id":"a1e2b3c4-024-4000-8000-0000000000024","name":"Combine Content Submissions","type":"n8n-nodes-base.merge","position":[1020,540],"parameters":{"mode":"append","numberInputs":2},"typeVersion":3.2},{"id":"a1e2b3c4-030-4000-8000-0000000000030","name":"Compile Telegram Message","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1280,260],"parameters":{"mode":"runOnceForAllItems","jsCode":"// One Telegram message per run. Counts come from $('NodeName') references\n// (proven pattern), each wrapped in try/catch: a branch that produced no\n// items this run must not crash the digest.\nconst fmt = (n) => n === 0 ? 'nothing new' : String(n) + ' URL' + (n === 1 ? '' : 's');\nconst safeLen = (nodeName) => { try { return $(nodeName).first().json.url_list.length; } catch (e) { return 0; } };\nconst countOk = (nodeName, pred) => {\n  try { return $(nodeName).all().filter(pred).length; } catch (e) { return 0; }\n};\nconst bingA = countOk('Submit Cornerstones to Bing', i => i.json.body && i.json.body.d === null);\nconst bingB = countOk('Submit Content to Bing', i => i.json.body && i.json.body.d === null);\nconst idxA = countOk('Push Cornerstones to IndexNow', i => i.json.statusCode === 200);\nconst idxB = countOk('Push Content to IndexNow', i => i.json.statusCode === 200);\nconst lines = [\n  '*SEO indexing run* - ' + new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10),\n  'Cornerstone/homepage: ' + fmt(safeLen('Collect Cornerstone URLs')),\n  'Content pages: ' + fmt(safeLen('Collect Content URLs')),\n  'Bing batches accepted: ' + (bingA + bingB),\n  'IndexNow batches OK: ' + (idxA + idxB),\n];\ntry {\n  const code = $('Resubmit Sitemap to Google API').first().json.statusCode;\n  lines.push('GSC sitemap resubmit: HTTP ' + code);\n} catch (e) { lines.push('GSC sitemap resubmit: failed (check credential/scope)'); }\nreturn [{ json: { digest: lines.join('\\n') } }];","language":"javaScript"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"a1e2b3c4-031-4000-8000-0000000000031","name":"Dispatch Telegram Digest","type":"n8n-nodes-base.telegram","position":[1520,260],"parameters":{"text":"={{ $json.digest }}","chatId":"YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID","additionalFields":{}},"typeVersion":1.2}],"active":false,"pinData":null,"settings":{"executionOrder":"v1"},"isArchived":false,"nodeGroups":[],"connections":{"Fetch Sitemap XML":{"main":[[{"node":"Parse Sitemap URLs","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Compile Telegram Message","type":"main","index":0}]]},"When Daily at 9am":{"main":[[{"node":"Fetch Sitemap XML","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Parse Sitemap URLs":{"main":[[{"node":"Verify URL Submission","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Gather Content URLs":{"main":[[{"node":"Post Content to Bing","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Post Content to IndexNow","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Post Content to Bing":{"main":[[{"node":"Combine Content Submissions","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Combine Content Submissions","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Verify URL Submission":{"main":[[{"node":"Determine URL Priority","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Determine URL Priority":{"main":[[{"node":"Route by Priority Level","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Gather Cornerstone URLs":{"main":[[{"node":"Post Cornerstones to Bing","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Post Cornerstones to IndexNow","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Resubmit Sitemap to Google API","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Route by Priority Level":{"main":[[{"node":"Note Cornerstone Submission","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Record Content Submission","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Bypass Low Priority URLs","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Compile Telegram Message":{"main":[[{"node":"Dispatch Telegram Digest","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Post Content to IndexNow":{"main":[[{"node":"Combine Content Submissions","type":"main","index":1}],[{"node":"Combine Content Submissions","type":"main","index":1}]]},"Post Cornerstones to Bing":{"main":[[{"node":"Combine Cornerstone Submissions","type":"main","index":1}],[{"node":"Combine Cornerstone Submissions","type":"main","index":1}]]},"Record Content Submission":{"main":[[{"node":"Gather Content URLs","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Combine Content Submissions":{"main":[[{"node":"Compile Telegram Message","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Note Cornerstone Submission":{"main":[[{"node":"Gather Cornerstone URLs","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Post Cornerstones to IndexNow":{"main":[[{"node":"Combine Cornerstone Submissions","type":"main","index":2}],[{"node":"Combine Cornerstone Submissions","type":"main","index":2}]]},"Resubmit Sitemap to Google API":{"main":[[{"node":"Combine Cornerstone Submissions","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Combine Cornerstone Submissions","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Combine Cornerstone Submissions":{"main":[[{"node":"Compile Telegram Message","type":"main","index":0}]]}}}